#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Install Syluxium: a step-by-step installer in the style of Linux Mint's
(language, keyboard, network, software, installation type with a partition
view, a time-zone map, your account, then a slideshow while it installs).
/usr/local/sbin/syluxium-install does the work.

SYLUXIUM_INSTALLER_SHOTS=<dir>: walk through every page with sample answers
and save a screenshot of each (for testing; nothing is installed)."""
